  "description": "Cha Min-Young has been busy every day serving her friend Yoon Tae-Ha, whom she has known for over 20 years, as her boss. Due to the shock of being betrayed by her boyfriend, she ends up having a one-night stand with Tae-Ha. After that impulsive night, Min-Young realizes that the old feelings she has felt for Tae-Ha were not just jealousy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/65531495), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%A4%ED%94%BC%EC%8A%A4-%ED%8C%8C%ED%8A%B8%EB%84%88-19%EC%84%B8-%EC%99%84%EC%A0%84%ED%8C%90/4324)    \nR15: [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/63657787)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \nR19: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177819)    \nR15: [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/177817)",
